      "id": "claim_ffbe3575707742fdb3de38bd76b467b6",
      "statement": "build.gradle.kts declares io.projectreactor.netty:reactor-netty-http as an explicit implementation dependency to pin the auto-configured outbound RestClient transport to Reactor Netty, because Spring AI 2.0.1 no longer brings it in transitively; without it Spring Boot auto-configuration would silently fall back to the JDK HttpClient transport for every outbound call (feed fetches, reader-view extraction, Raindrop).",
