      "id": "claim_349fdbef4ba8408b838fcf51579a6c3f",
      "statement": "'./gradlew currentVersion -q' emits terminal control escape sequences rather than plain text, so the release pipeline's VERSION= line pipes the output through \"grep 'Project version'\" before extracting the version with awk to avoid contaminating the shell variable.",
