    {
      "id": "claim_96eea2b9240346ed82cb5d7d3b4e6b17",
      "statement": "A machine-wide 'git lfs install' can leave a git-lfs pre-push hook in .git/hooks/ that runs 'git lfs pre-push' even though this repository has no LFS content, intermittently failing 'git push' and the gitPushRelease Exec task with a Git LFS locking-API error; the fix is 'git config lfs.https://github.com/sbartram/myfeeder.git/info/lfs.locksverify false', which is already set in this clone but must be re-applied after a fresh clone.",
